Z||000001||Nashco||12-13-2001||08:00 PM||||Geez, first Archie, then this!<P>"Where is the website?<BR>The FBI confiscated every server at the network we were hosting this site at because they suspected software piracy was taking place, which we had no part of.<BR>What does this mean? - it means they have our server and all the information so for right now the site is gone.<BR>When will it be back up? - I will have a temporary site up soon that you will be able to upload your photos to, but all the old information is being held captive by feds until we get it back.<BR>How can they do that? What jerks! - We don't know how they can do it, they didn't have a warrant for the server that this website was on and they just took every computer in the facility that they suspected of pirating warez.<BR>Check back later today or tomorrow for the temp site until we get the other one back.<P>-Webmaster<P><BR>P.S. any questions can be emailed to RateMyRide@AOL.com"<P>------------------<BR>Bryce<BR>88 GT<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/nashcosig.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||DKOV||12-13-2001||08:33 PM||||Okay, not to kick a dead horse but RateMyRide.com was a joke when it came to accurate reporting of ratings....<P>The "shaggy van" was topping out tricked Vipers?  I don't think so...  Also, If a guy wanted to trash someone else's ratings, they just put "1" about 1000 times and kill the averages.  Same way on boosting an average, just put "10" a few hundred times and BAM, you're at the top!<P>Totally lame.  One Vote, one average, one time.  That is the way it should be done.<P>Looking at some cars that were rated 104th out of 10 were suddenly 1st with 600 botes the next day???<P>OK... just for fun, I know.  But when I see all those Fieros (not any of mine) getting their butts kicked by a Pinto...!!!<P>Thanks.  This concludes the emergency venting system.  Had this been an actual venting...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>DKOV -||||reg||1
